🚨 RescueAI – Rescue Smart Emergency Agent.

RescueAI is an emergency response planning agent designed to help people respond to natural disasters such as floods, 
earthquakes, cyclones, and other emergencies. It analyzes user-reported emergency information,
identifies the possible disaster category, assigns a preliminary priority level, and generates actionable safety recommendations.

The system provides a simple interface where users can enter the emergency location and describe the situation. 
Based on the report, RescueAI generates a structured response plan, suggests relevant emergency resource categories,
and provides an interactive task checklist to support emergency coordination.

The goal of RescueAI is to improve emergency awareness, organize critical information, 
and support faster decision-making during disasters through AI-assisted technology.

Key Features:
• 🚨 Emergency report analysis and disaster classification.
• ⚠️ Preliminary emergency priority assessment.
• 🛡️ Disaster-specific safety recommendations.
• 🤝 Suggested emergency coordination resources.
• ✅ Interactive responder task checklist.
• 🌐 Simple and user-friendly web interface.

Technology Stack: Python, Streamlit, rule-based text classification, Git, and GitHub.

Expected Impact: RescueAI aims to help people organize emergency information, understand recommended safety actions,
and coordinate response activities more effectively during critical situations.

Important technical note: The current prototype uses keyword-based classification.
It does not detect disasters automatically or access real-time disaster data.
Real-time detection and verified alerts are planned improvements.
